<!-- The app locks to portrait (buildozer.spec: orientation = portrait), and Android reads
     a portrait-locked activity as *requiring* a portrait screen. Play Console then hides
     the app from devices that don't report one (some tablets, Chromebooks, Android XR)
     and refused to send 1.5.0 for review. Declaring the feature optional keeps the
     portrait layout everywhere it can be had without excluding anyone. -->
<uses-feature android:name="android.hardware.screen.portrait" android:required="false" />
